# Cloudflare Pages headers (docs/DECISIONS.md, M0 and M5): the page and the small helper scripts are
# revalidated by ETag on every visit, so a new deploy is picked up at once. The engine files carry a
# content hash in their name (k-<hash>.*, tools/pack_wasm.mjs) and never change: cached for a year.
/*
  Cache-Control: no-cache
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
/k-*
  ! Cache-Control
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
